+## Service tier
+
+`request.service_tier` is forwarded unchanged to the provider on every model
+call, including harness summary compaction, which copies the action request
+settings. Omit it to use the provider default (standard processing).
+Configuration loading validates the value for the Google Interactions runtime
+(`flex`, `standard`, `priority`) and the OpenAI Responses and Chat Completions
+runtimes (`auto`, `default`, `flex`, `scale`, `priority`). Run metadata records
+the requested tier as `requested_service_tier`, and each step record stores the
+tier the provider reported for the accepted response as `service_tier`. A
+reported tier that differs from an explicit request other than `auto` is
+logged as a warning. Both fields are omitted when absent.
+
 ## Recording and provenance
 
 ### xAI Responses
